                    </div>
                </div>

                <div style="background:rgba(245,158,11,0.04);border-radius:12px;padding:0.8rem 1rem;margin-bottom:0.6rem;border:1px solid rgba(245,158,11,0.04);">
                    <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.5rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.3);font-size:0.75rem;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:0.3rem;">⏭️ 导航指令</div>
                    <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:0.3rem;">
                        <span style="background:rgba(245,158,11,0.06);padding:0.15rem 0.6rem;border-radius:12px;font-size:0.7rem;color:#F59E0B;">"下一题"</span>
                        <span style="background:rgba(245,158,11,0.06);padding:0.15rem 0.6rem;border-radius:12px;font-size:0.7rem;color:#F59E0B;">"跳过"</span>
                        <span style="background:rgba(245,158,11,0.06);padding:0.15rem 0.6rem;border-radius:12px;font-size:0.7rem;color:#F59E0B;">"取消"</span>
                        <span style="background:rgba(245,158,11,0.06);padding:0.15rem 0.6rem;border-radius:12px;font-size:0.7rem;color:#F59E0B;">"删除"</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div style="background:rgba(79,172,254,0.04);border-radius:12px;padding:0.6rem 1rem;margin-bottom:1rem;border:1px solid rgba(79,172,254,0.04);">
                    <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.5rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.15);font-size:0.65rem;">
                        <span>💡</span>
                        <span>你说话时屏幕下方会显示识别文字，看到后说 <strong style="color:#8B5CF6;">"确认"</strong> 提交</span>
                    </div>
                    <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.5rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.15);font-size:0.65rem;margin-top:0.2rem;">
                        <span>🎯</span>
                        <span>说 <strong style="color:#F59E0B;">"帮助"</strong> 随时打开完整教程</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <button onclick="document.getElementById('voiceTutorialOverlay').remove()" style="width:100%;padding:0.8rem;border:none;border-radius:40px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#8B5CF6,#EC4899);color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:0.95rem;cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit;transition:all 0.3s ease;">
